  ],
  "details": "<p>The <em>tribus Fabia</em> was one of the older rural tribes of Rome and its name derives from the Roman <em>gens Fabia</em>, one of the most ancient patrician families of Rome. The territory of the tribe is presumed to have been located in the land of the Fabii on the right bank of the Tiber river.</p>",
